# --- RPC (reads) -----------------------------------------------------------
# REQUIRED for the yield figures. An archive-capable Polygon PoS RPC
# (QuickNode / Alchemy / Infura): the realised trailing APY scans 30 days of the
# accountant's share-price events and a wallet's earnings scans its Teller
# deposits — ranged eth_getLogs that public endpoints typically refuse.
#
# A 30-day window is ~1.73M Polygon blocks (~173 chunked eth_getLogs calls), so
# the endpoint must allow ranged log queries and a decent request rate.
#
# The app does NOT verify the endpoint. Left empty it falls back to a public one,
# where TVL, share price, deposits and redemptions still work but the yield
# figures show "—" with an inline error.
#
# Vite only reads VITE_-prefixed variables — a bare POLYGON_RPC_URL is ignored.
VITE_RPC_URL=

# How many eth_getLogs chunk requests a history scan keeps in flight (default 4).
VITE_HISTORY_CHUNKS_IN_FLIGHT=4

# --- WalletConnect (writes) -----------------------------------------------
# Project id from https://cloud.reown.com (WalletConnect). Optional: injected
# wallets (MetaMask, Rabby, ...) work without it; WalletConnect/mobile QR needs it.
VITE_WALLETCONNECT_PROJECT_ID=
